     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Comparing routes",
     "texto": [
      "To say «faster than», we use **mai rapid decât**. The adjective agrees with the noun: **trenul direct** is masculine; **ruta directă**, feminine."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Direct train or with changes",
     "texto": [
      "In the timetables you can see **directe** routes and **cu schimbări** routes («with changes»). **Întârziere** is «delay» and **conexiune** is the connection with another train."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
